== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* This spell can be cast on seemingly unarmed creatures (such as animals) to target one of their [[natural weapon]]s (even though the effect will not be reported in the [[character sheet]]). The "right" slot is targeted if possible; the "bite" slot otherwise. A creature with only a "left" weapon (e.g. some [[polymorph]]s) will not benefit from this spell.
* This will replace any existing temporary enhancement bonus (e.g. from ''[[blackstaff]]'').

